## Phase 2 — Quote-dependent factors (skip or proxy if no quote/axe data)

### P2.1 — Imbalance family (F6, F7, F8)
> I have [describe: composite quotes / dealer axes / nothing]. Implement `factors/imbalance.py`: F6 best-quote imbalance with an OU fit (estimate γ by AR(1) on the imbalance series; report the half-life log2/γ and refuse to emit the factor at horizons > 3 half-lives); F7 the OBP grid with dealers-as-levels, lookbacks {1,5,21}d, emitted as a feature vector not a scalar; F8 OFI on composite quote revisions, event-clocked. If I said "nothing": implement the trade-based proxies the compendium specifies (axe-count imbalance → Π_t from F5; OFI → skip with NaN) and mark proxy columns with a `_proxy` suffix.

