## Order of execution (dependency DAG)

P0.1 → P0.2 → P0.3 → P0.4 → P0.5 → P0.6 → {P1.1–P1.6, P2.1 in any order} → P3.1 → P3.2 (needs P1.1) → P3.3 → P3.4 → P3.5 (needs P1.1, P2.1/proxies, P3.1) → P3.6 → P3.7 → P4.1 → P4.2 → P4.3 → P4.4 → P5.1 → P5.2

Total: 24 prompts. The synthetic generator (P0.2 option 3) is what makes the whole sequence testable today, before any data subscription: every later prompt's acceptance check refers back to the planted effects in `SYNTHETIC_TRUTH.md`.